The cause is that `HomeDetail` is a server component passing `component={Link}` to a MUI `Box`, which is a client component. The docs' fix is a `"use client"` wrapper for `Link`. I'll add `components/Link.tsx` and use it in `HomeDetail.tsx`. `HomeCard` and `MapView` are already client files, so they're unaffected, but I'll use the wrapper there as well for consistency.

```ts lib/data.ts
export type HomeType = "Apartment" | "House" | "Studio";

export interface Home {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  type: HomeType;
